    <dashboardType>SpecifiedUser</dashboardType>
    <description>Dashboard components show &quot;All Leads&quot; based on the filter in the underlying reports. To see &quot;My Leads&quot; or &quot;My Team&apos;s Leads,&quot; clone the dashboard and point components to reports with a different filter setting.</description>
    <isGridLayout>false</isGridLayout>
